  {
    "jd_id": "JD-002",
    "jd_title": "Software Developer - Intern",
    "company_name": "Bouygues Construction IT Vietnam",
    "domain_category": "Frontend",
    "job_level": "Intern",
    "original_jd_text": "Bouygues Construction IT Vietnam is a part of Bouygues Construction IT, a trusted partner for the business lines which provides competitiveness of the Bouygues Construction Group and promotes its digital transformation.\nIn the software development service, we will provide solutions for our collaborator from Bouygues Construction Group with various web and mobile applications which support their daily works in different business scopes: purchasing, communication, finance, … By this position, your key responsibilities will be:\nDesign, and develop new features in both Front-end and Back-end sites\nLearn development framework, perform design and coding\nPerform test applications and system\nMake plans and control the work progress as scheduled\nOur Requirements\nStandard development knowledge, skill in Java, PHP, or other programming languages\nBasic Front-end programming skills with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Bootstrap, especially is Angular\nGood knowledge and skill in using Unit test (Junit, JMock, …)\nGood knowledge of Design Pattern\nUnderstanding of the software development process\nGood at English. French is a big plus\nGeneral Skills\nGood communication skills\nGood problem-solving and research skills\nEnergetic and eager to tackle new projects and ideas\nWell-organized and can-do attitude\nGood mindset, positive thinking\nOur Benefits\nProfessional, Open-minded and Creative Environment:\nInternational, friendly, proactive, supportive workplace.\nGreat teamwork with Agile mindset.\nFostering mutual respect and understanding.\nStrong sharing culture to improve individual development.\nIndividual Development\nExtensive training and in-depth knowledge sharing sessions.\nOnline internal learning hub with various categories in hard skills & soft skills (languages, programming language, data visualization…).\nIndividual empowerment.\nSpecial Care\nFor Intern:\nAttractive monthly internship allowance.\nDell laptop and external monitor for your work.\nPremium health insurance.\n1 paid leave day per month.\nFor Full-time Employee\nWork from home 2 days/ week.\n100% salary on probationary period.\nPerformance bonus.\n15 annual leave days + 6 sick leave days (plus 1 annual leave day for every 3-year working).\nAnnual health check-up and premium health insurance for employee (and your beloved children after 3-working year).\nVarious attractive teambuilding activities and company trip.\nSport, personal activities sponsor.",
    "requirements_text": "Design, and develop new features in both Front-end and Back-end sites\nLearn development framework, perform design and coding\nPerform test applications and system\nMake plans and control the work progress as scheduled\nStandard development knowledge, skill in Java, PHP, or other programming languages\nBasic Front-end programming skills with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Bootstrap, especially is Angular\nGood knowledge and skill in using Unit test (Junit, JMock, …)\nGood knowledge of Design Pattern\nUnderstanding of the software development process\nGood at English. French is a big plus\nGood communication skills\nGood problem-solving and research skills\nEnergetic and eager to tackle new projects and ideas\nWell-organized and can-do attitude\nGood mindset, positive thinking\nInternational, friendly, proactive, supportive workplace.\nGreat teamwork with Agile mindset.\nFostering mutual respect and understanding.\nStrong sharing culture to improve individual development.\nExtensive training and in-depth knowledge sharing sessions.\nOnline internal learning hub with various categories in hard skills & soft skills (languages, programming language, data visualization…).\nIndividual empowerment.\nAttractive monthly internship allowance.\nDell laptop and external monitor for your work.\nPremium health insurance.\n1 paid leave day per month.\nWork from home 2 days/ week.\n100% salary on probationary period.\nPerformance bonus.\n15 annual leave days + 6 sick leave days (plus 1 annual leave day for every 3-year working).\nAnnual health check-up and premium health insurance for employee (and your beloved children after 3-working year).\nVarious attractive teambuilding activities and company trip.\nSport, personal activities sponsor.",
