  {
    "jd_id": "JD-007",
    "jd_title": "SeniorJava Developer",
    "company_name": "CÔNG TY TNHH TẬP ĐOÀN CÔNG NGHỆ WIKEX EXCHANGE",
    "domain_category": "Backend",
    "job_level": "Senior",
    "original_jd_text": "Giới thiệu công ty\nThu nhập:\nUp to 2,000 USD\nLoại hình:\nToàn thời gian\nChức vụ:\nNhân viên\nKinh nghiệm:\n4 năm\njava\nbackend\npostgresql\nmongodb\nMô tả công việc\nDevelop and maintain backend applications using Java (Spring Boot, Hibernate).\nIntegrate systems with databases (MySQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB) and external services.\nParticipate in requirements analysis, propose technical solutions, and optimize system performance.\nYêu cầu\nExperience in system design and solution architecture in Fintech, Securities Core Systems, etc.\nUniversity Degree in Information Technology, Computer Science, or a related field.\n4 years of experience in Java development.\nExperience in Web3 or Blockchain.\nExperience with Java, Java Spring Boot, and JPA.\nExperience with message broker systems such as RocketMQ, [protected info]\nExperience with databases including MongoDB, PostgreSQL, MySQL, and Redis.\nKnowledge of managing configurations using Nacos is a plus.\nKnowledge of Seata and Sentinel is a plus.\nPreferred candidates have experience with blockchain technologies, startups, or fast-paced tech environments.\nGood English communication ability.\nQuyền lợi\nSalary: Up to $2,000\nFriendly working environment: dynamic, creative, professional, and diverse environment with personal development opportunities.\nWorking time: from Monday to Saturday, 9am to 6pm (but only 2 Saturdays in a month).\nBonus according to revenue and capacity: 13th month salary bonus and holidays (depending on business results).\nNew Year's bonus, New Year's gift, etc.\nPeriodic salary increase based on work efficiency.",
    "requirements_text": "Experience in system design and solution architecture in Fintech, Securities Core Systems, etc.\nUniversity Degree in Information Technology, Computer Science, or a related field.\n4 years of experience in Java development.\nExperience in Web3 or Blockchain.\nExperience with Java, Java Spring Boot, and JPA.\nExperience with message broker systems such as RocketMQ, [protected info]\nExperience with databases including MongoDB, PostgreSQL, MySQL, and Redis.\nKnowledge of managing configurations using Nacos is a plus.\nKnowledge of Seata and Sentinel is a plus.\nPreferred candidates have experience with blockchain technologies, startups, or fast-paced tech environments.\nGood English communication ability.",
