  {
    "jd_id": "JD-009",
    "jd_title": "Senior JavaBackend DeveloperSpring Boot",
    "company_name": "CÔNG TY CỔ PHẦN EASTGATE SOFTWARE",
    "domain_category": "Backend",
    "job_level": "Senior",
    "original_jd_text": "Giới thiệu công ty\nThu nhập:\nVery Attractive!!!\nLoại hình:\nToàn thời gian\nChức vụ:\nNhân viên\nKinh nghiệm:\n7 năm\njava\nbackend\nspring\nsoftware development\nMô tả công việc\nTop 3 Reasons To Join Us\nCompetitive Salary Package\nDynamic & Flexible Working Environment\nWorking with experts from around Europe and USA\nThe Job\nFounded in 2014, Eastgate Software is a software development company that builds custom business solutions and applications. We are proud of our highly qualified staff who have more than 20 years of experience in software development including web, mobile and desktop applications.\nWe put quality and customer satisfaction as the top priorities in every project we carry out. Therefore, our German and US senior experts offer local consultancy for European and US clients.\nAs a member of Eastgate, you will be emerged in a professional and flexible environment where you have opportunities to express your own ideas and improve your skill set through many interesting full-cycle projects.\nYour responsibilities:\nDevelop the technical direction for\ncloud-based microservices projects\n, including:\nTraffic Analytics (24/7 system)\nData services for traffic light controllers\nDesign system architecture, define technical standards, and perform code reviews.\nCollaborate with clients to analyze requirements and propose optimal technical solutions.\nEnsure software quality through testing, code reviews, and code quality management tools.\nCoordinate with DevOps, QA, and Frontend teams to ensure smooth deployment and operations.\nParticipate in Agile/Scrum processes, maintaining project quality and delivery timelines.\nYour Skills and Experience\n7+ years of professional software\ndevelopment experience.\nBachelor's degree or higher in Computer Science, Information Technology, or related fields.\nStrong expertise in:\nJava Core, OOP, Design Patterns, Clean Code, and SOLID Principles.\nSpring Framework (Spring Boot, Spring Security, Spring Data, Spring Cloud).\nRESTful API and Microservices Architecture.\nORM tools such as Hibernate or EclipseLink.\nUnit Testing (JUnit 5, Mockito), Maven/Gradle build tools.\nHands-on experience with:\nDocker, Kubernetes, Helm.\nMessage Queues: Kafka, RabbitMQ.\nCache: Redis.\nMonitoring & Logging: Grafana, Prometheus, ELK or Loki.\nIAM: Keycloak (OAuth2, OpenID Connect).\nCode quality: SonarQube.\nPreferred qualifications:\nExperience in distributed, high-availability, or high-performance systems.\nExperience with CI/CD pipelines and cloud environments.\nSoft skills:\nProblem-solving mindset and ability to work independently.\nGood English skills ( - IELTS 5.5)\nWhy You'll Love Working Here\nAttractive salary package.\nEastgate Software is a\nGlobal Fortune 500 Preferred Vendor\n, so you will have an opportunity to work with many IT Experts around Europe and USA.\nBe emerged in a professional and motivating environment where you have opportunities to express your own ideas and improve your skill set through many interesting full-cycle projects.\nFlexible working time: 9:30 a.m. to 6:30 p.m., Monday to Friday,\nNo Overtime\n(Only 8 working hours)\nPerformance review and appropriate gratification: twice a year.\n13th\nmonth salary +\nProject bonus\n+\n02 probationary months\nwith\nfull salary\nExtra\nhealth check package\nper year.\n16 leave days/year\n(\nwith 12 annual leave days and 4 paid leave days for learning activities\n)\n. You will be added an extra day each year and a maximum of\n20 days\nfor annual leave.\nFree snacks, video gaming & movie nights, team social and sport activities.\nYêu cầu\nJava, OOP, Docker, English, Spring Boot, Spring\nQuyền lợi\nAttractive salary package.\nEastgate Software is a\nGlobal Fortune 500 Preferred Vendor\n, so you will have an opportunity to work with many IT Experts around Europe and USA.\nBe emerged in a professional and motivating environment where you have opportunities to express your own ideas and improve your skill set through many interesting full-cycle projects.\nFlexible working time: 9:30 a.m. to 6:30 p.m., Monday to Friday,\nNo Overtime\n(Only 8 working hours)\nPerformance review and appropriate gratification: twice a year.\n13th\nmonth salary +\nProject bonus\n+\n02 probationary months\nwith\nfull salary\nExtra\nhealth check package\nper year.\n16 leave days/year\n(\nwith 12 annual leave days and 4 paid leave days for learning activities\n)\n. You will be added an extra day each year and a maximum of\n20 days\nfor annual leave.\nFree snacks, video gaming & movie nights, team social and sport activities.",
    "requirements_text": "Experience in distributed, high-availability, or high-performance systems.\nExperience with CI/CD pipelines and cloud environments.\nSoft skills:\nProblem-solving mindset and ability to work independently.\nGood English skills ( - IELTS 5.5)\nWhy You'll Love Working Here\nAttractive salary package.\nEastgate Software is a\nGlobal Fortune 500 Preferred Vendor\n, so you will have an opportunity to work with many IT Experts around Europe and USA.\nBe emerged in a professional and motivating environment where you have opportunities to express your own ideas and improve your skill set through many interesting full-cycle projects.\nFlexible working time: 9:30 a.m. to 6:30 p.m., Monday to Friday,\nNo Overtime\n(Only 8 working hours)\nPerformance review and appropriate gratification: twice a year.\nmonth salary +\nProject bonus\n02 probationary months\nfull salary\nhealth check package\nper year.\n16 leave days/year\nwith 12 annual leave days and 4 paid leave days for learning activities\n. You will be added an extra day each year and a maximum of\n20 days\nfor annual leave.\nFree snacks, video gaming & movie nights, team social and sport activities.\nJava, OOP, Docker, English, Spring Boot, Spring",
    "review_status": "PENDING",
