  {
    "jd_id": "JD-020",
    "jd_title": "[Junior]Mobile Developer(Flutter)",
    "company_name": "CÔNG TY TNHH ANFIN",
    "domain_category": "Mobile",
    "job_level": "Intern",
    "original_jd_text": "Giới thiệu công ty\nThu nhập:\nThỏa thuận\nLoại hình:\nToàn thời gian\nChức vụ:\nNhân viên\nKinh nghiệm:\n1 - 2 năm\nphần mềm\nmobile\nandroid\nios\nMô tả công việc\nDevelop features for mobile applications on Android and IOS (phone & tablet).\nWork closely with UI/UX\ndesigner\ns to understand feature specifications.\nWork closely with backend engineers for API integration.\nDevelop good performance and UI/UX for end-users.\nDesign, review and execute tests for client-side apps.\nIdentify, record, document & categorize usability issues.\nCommunicate with other team members to determine the best solutions to difficult issues.\nInvestigate and use new technologies where relevant.\nYêu cầu\nBachelor's/Master's degree in computer science/engineering or equivalent professional experience.\nHave 1-2 years of experience in developing appsusing Flutter.\nExperience with clean architecture for mobile applications.\nStrong knowledge of dependency injection (DI) in Flutter.\nStrong knowledge of State management.\nExperienced with Test-driven development.\nGood knowledge and experience with UI & UX.\nStrong desire to learn and to grow.\nAbility to work under high-pressure.\nBalance between fast-code and quality-code.\nAbility to work independently, teamwork.\nValidated ability to excel in a fast-paced development team.\nHaving a product mindset is an advantage.\nQuyền lợi\nHighly competitive compensation packages.\n100% salary for probation period.\nPerformance review annually.\nProviding a MacBook and monitor to ensure the quality of work.\nCompany events such as International Women's Day, Vietnamese Women's Day, Christmas, Company trips, and year-end parties.\nBe a member of Anfin's Football and Badminton club.\nBonus for the referral program, birthday, teambuilding,...\n13th-month salary.\n17 leave days including 12 annual leave and 5 sick leave.\nPeriodic medical examination.\nIn addition to Social insurance, providing premium health insurance pays most medical and healthcare expenses.\nOpportunity to learn about financial literacy from industry experts to build an integrated brokerage offering a variety of asset classes.\nBe mentored by a leadership team who has extensive entrepreneurship experience, successfully founding and exciting Tech companies.\nWorking hour: Monday to Friday (from 80 am to 50 pm).\nThông tin khác\nThời gian làm việc:\nTừ Thứ 2 đến Thứ 6 ([protected info])",
    "requirements_text": "Bachelor's/Master's degree in computer science/engineering or equivalent professional experience.\nHave 1-2 years of experience in developing appsusing Flutter.\nExperience with clean architecture for mobile applications.\nStrong knowledge of dependency injection (DI) in Flutter.\nStrong knowledge of State management.\nExperienced with Test-driven development.\nGood knowledge and experience with UI & UX.\nStrong desire to learn and to grow.\nAbility to work under high-pressure.\nBalance between fast-code and quality-code.\nAbility to work independently, teamwork.\nValidated ability to excel in a fast-paced development team.\nHaving a product mindset is an advantage.",
