  {
    "jd_id": "JD-027",
    "jd_title": "Thực tập sinh Tester/Quality Assurance có lương hỗ trợ",
    "company_name": "CÔNG TY CỔ PHẦN CÔNG NGHỆ VÀ DỊCH VỤ CODLUCK",
    "domain_category": "QA/QC",
    "job_level": "Intern",
    "original_jd_text": "Giới thiệu công ty\nThu nhập:\n500000 VND\nLoại hình:\nToàn thời gian\nChức vụ:\nThực tập sinh\nphần mềm\ntester\nsoftware testing\ntest cases\nMô tả công việc\nParticipate in software testing, analyze and record defects, and summarize and report test results.\nCreate test cases for assigned tasks and modules.\nPerform other duties as assigned by the supervisor/manager.\nYêu cầu\nBasic knowledge of the software development lifecycle and the role of a\nTester\n.\nFundamental understanding of software testing concepts.\nGood logical thinking, strong interest in QA/Testing, and willingness to pursue long-term career development in this field.\nPositive working attitude, proactive in learning, willing to ask questions, and capable of problem-solving.\nJapanese and/or English proficiency is a plus.\nAbility to work onsite at least 5 days per week.\nQuyền lợi\nInternship allowance: VND 500,000/month.\nTraining from basic to advanced levels in professional skills and programming knowledge.\nOpportunity to become a full-time employee early.\nAllowance provided during the training period, including support for internship confirmation documents and official stamped certificates.\nOn-the-job training and participation in real company projects during the training period.\nParticipation in company activities and corporate culture programs.\nBenefits (Full-time Employee)\nAttractive income, 100% salary during probation.\nClear career advancement based on performance and capability.\nSupport for professional certification exams.\nYoung, dynamic, and creative working environment.\nMinimum of 13 months' salary per year.\nSalary review and project bonus twice a year based on performance and work effectiveness (total income approximately 14 months' salary per year).\nHoliday, New Year, wedding, bereavement, and special occasion bonuses.\nSocial insurance, health insurance, and unemployment insurance in accordance with government regulations.\nPublic holidays according to labor law.\nOther benefits: annual team building, weekly happy hour, etc.\nAnnual health check.\nAnnual company trip.\nLaptop and modern working equipment provided.\nParticipation in company clubs: football club, badminton club, etc.\nFree English classes organized by the company.\nWorking Hours:\n8:00 AM - 5:00 PM, Monday to Friday",
    "requirements_text": "Basic knowledge of the software development lifecycle and the role of a\nTester\nFundamental understanding of software testing concepts.\nGood logical thinking, strong interest in QA/Testing, and willingness to pursue long-term career development in this field.\nPositive working attitude, proactive in learning, willing to ask questions, and capable of problem-solving.\nJapanese and/or English proficiency is a plus.\nAbility to work onsite at least 5 days per week.",
    "review_status": "PENDING",
