  {
    "jd_id": "JD-036",
    "jd_title": "SoftwareDeveloperIntern 5G",
    "company_name": "Endava Limited Liability Company",
    "domain_category": "DevOps",
    "job_level": "Intern",
    "original_jd_text": "Giới thiệu công ty\nThu nhập:\nYou'll love it\nLoại hình:\nThực tập\nChức vụ:\nThực tập sinh\nphần mềm\n5g\ndesign\nprogramming\nMô tả công việc\nTop 3 Reasons To Join Us\nValuing our people with competitive compensation\nSupporting our people's health and wellbeing\nEmpowering our people to grow and thrive\nThe Job\nCompany Description\nTechnology is our how. And people are our why.\nBy combining world-class engineering, industry expertise and a people-centric mindset, we consult and partner with our customers to create technological solutions that drive innovation and transform businesses.\nFrom ideation to production, we support businesses with bespoke solutions across various industries, including payments, insurance, finance and banking, technology, media, telecommunications, retail and consumer goods, supply chain, healthcare and life sciences, automotive and travel.\nJob Description\nDevelopment is the largest discipline at Endava. Our developers design, build, and release software products in multiple programming languages, frameworks, and libraries. Always collaborating with cross-functional project teams, our developers are adaptable problem-solvers with a client-oriented mindset.\nAs a 5G Radio Software Intern, you will have a chance to learn and practice with general technologies used in RADIO software such as C++, Autotools, Socket programming, Linux, Bash script, Git, Unit test, Automation test, GDB, Valgrind, .... Understanding overview about the system is also an important goal of this internship.\nThe project's purpose is to design and develop a Radio Base Station (RBS) simulator.\nRBS is a part of Radio Access Network in Mobile Network. RBS simulator is a simulation of an RBS which is a part of a Mobile Network in telecommunication system. It is the fixed transceiver that is the main communication point for wireless mobile client devices.\nAgile/Scrum will be used during this project.\nYour Skills and Experience\nIf you are studying or have just graduated from University with a Bachelor Degree in either Information Technology, Computer Science, Electronic and Telecommunication or a related degree with:\nStrong IT background;\nC/C++ software development passion;\nHigh teamwork spirit;\nEager to learn new technologies;\nBasic English communication;\nKnowledge about embedded system, Realtime OS, Linux and Telecommunication is an advantage;\nNote: When applying, please send us your CV together with your latest academic transcript.\nWhy You'll Love Working Here\nInternship allowance.\nOpportunities to become Endavan after the internship.\nAn excellent working environment in developing tomorrow's features.\nOpen and honest culture where people are valued, treated fairly, trusted and empowered.\nTraining and career development opportunities.\nThe opportunity to join our English club and community.\nGood working facilities.\nOther company activities.\nAt Endava, we're committed to creating an open, inclusive, and respectful environment where everyone feels safe, valued, and empowered to be their best. We welcome applications from people of all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives-because we know that inclusive teams help us deliver smarter, more innovative solutions for our customers. Hiring decisions are based on merit, skills, qualifications, and potential. If you need adjustments or support during the recruitment process, please let us know.\nYêu cầu\nC++, Networking, Git, Linux, C language, Internship Accepted\nQuyền lợi\nInternship allowance.\nOpportunities to become Endavan after the internship.\nAn excellent working environment in developing tomorrow's features.\nOpen and honest culture where people are valued, treated fairly, trusted and empowered.\nTraining and career development opportunities.\nThe opportunity to join our English club and community.\nGood working facilities.\nOther company activities.\nAt Endava, we're committed to creating an open, inclusive, and respectful environment where everyone feels safe, valued, and empowered to be their best. We welcome applications from people of all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives-because we know that inclusive teams help us deliver smarter, more innovative solutions for our customers. Hiring decisions are based on merit, skills, qualifications, and potential. If you need adjustments or support during the recruitment process, please let us know.",
