  {
    "jd_id": "JD-041",
    "jd_title": "Internship Programs - DevOps",
    "company_name": "Công Ty Cổ Phần NCCPLUS Việt Nam",
    "domain_category": "DevOps",
    "job_level": "Intern",
    "original_jd_text": "Giới thiệu công ty\nThu nhập:\nThỏa thuận\nLoại hình:\nThực tập\nChức vụ:\nThực tập sinh\nKinh nghiệm:\n10 năm\nphần mềm\ndevops\nprogramming\nlinux\nMô tả công việc\nYour tasks will be discussed in more details during the interview.\nWill be trained by your mentor and the DevOps team\nYêu cầu\nEither Full-time or Part-time (Minimum 30hs/week but more hours is welcomed).\nMust have a laptop with minimum requirements: 8GB Ram, SSD and i3.\nGood logical thinking in programming.\nHave basic under standing about Linux infrastructures , Agile workflow methodologies,...\nGood interpersonal skills and communication with all levels of management.\nAble to multitask, prioritize, and manage time efficiently.\nQuyền lợi\nWill provide support during your job (can discuss more details during the interview).\nLunch allowance of 1,000,000 VND per month.\nPotentially become an official employee with the company benefits.\nParticipating in Knowledge Sharing sessions with OpenTalk, MiniTalk weekly.\nEnjoy all of our activities such as Company's Birthday, YEP, Sport/Game/Code War Contest,...\nWe have these clubs for you to join: Football, Table football, Music, English, media and more.\nThe office is pleasant, and fully equipped with an attractive pantry with snacks, tea, coffee, and milo,...\nGet advices for career development.\nThông tin khác\nNCCPLUS Vietnam Joint Stock Company is a software firm and IT outsourcing service provider located in Vietnam. With 10 years of experience, we specialize in mobile and web application development, cloud and microservices development, game development, blockchain development, software testing, AI and IoT, and VoIP development. We work with clients in various fields such as public administration, education, finance & banking, insurance, healthcare, retail & ecommerce, sports, and entertainment. Our mission is to constantly enhance knowledge and capabilities to meet the divergent needs of the market and become a symbol of the IT outsourcing field.",
    "requirements_text": "Either Full-time or Part-time (Minimum 30hs/week but more hours is welcomed).\nGood logical thinking in programming.\nHave basic under standing about Linux infrastructures , Agile workflow methodologies,...\nGood interpersonal skills and communication with all levels of management.\nAble to multitask, prioritize, and manage time efficiently.",
