  {
    "jd_id": "JD-045",
    "jd_title": "[VELA]AI ENGINEERINTERN (Smart Input / OCR)",
    "company_name": "Công ty cổ phần giao nhận và vận chuyển indo trần",
    "domain_category": "AI/Data",
    "job_level": "Intern",
    "original_jd_text": "Giới thiệu công ty\nThu nhập:\nThỏa thuận\nLoại hình:\nThực tập\nChức vụ:\nThực tập sinh\nphần mềm\nresearch\ncomputer vision\ndatasets\n[VELA] AI ENGINEER INTERN (Smart Input / OCR)\nChia sẻ\n1. PURPOSE AND SCOPE\nSupport the research, development, and maintenance of AI-based document processing solutions for logistics applications using OCR and Computer Vision technologies. Work closely with AI Engineers and Software\nDeveloper\ns to gain practical experience in image processing, AI model development, and intelligent document processing for real-world applications.\n2. RESPONSIBILITY\nSupport the development of OCR solutions for logistics documents.\nPerform image preprocessing and document enhancement for OCR tasks.\nPrepare and annotate datasets for AI model training and evaluation.\nAssist in training, testing, fine-tuning, and improving AI/OCR models.\nIntegrate AI/OCR models with applications through REST APIs.\nDebug and troubleshoot AI models to improve performance and accuracy.\nCollaborate with team members and participate in Agile/Scrum activities.\n3.QUALIFICATION\nPursuing or recently completed a degree in Artificial Intelligence, Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field.\nStrong foundation in Python, Machine Learning, Deep Learning, and Computer Vision.\nFamiliar with OpenCV and AI frameworks such as PyTorch or TensorFlow.\nKnowledge of OCR technologies (PaddleOCR, EasyOCR, or Tesseract) is a plus.\nBasic understanding of REST APIs and Git.\nAbility to read and understand technical documentation in English.\nGood analytical, problem-solving, teamwork, and communication skills.\nPrevious academic or personal projects related to AI, Computer Vision, or OCR are an advantage.",
